From 65d5d4d1847e5aefed0ec6387594567f867ae033 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 21:35:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] i18n: kill raw HTML-entity artifacts in menu labels (RU
 Administration '&shy;', TR menu5_2_1 '&#39;')
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Field report: Russian 'Administration' menu (menu5_6) showed the literal text
'Администрирование' with a visible '&shy;' - correct on the Home/dashboard, raw
on every stock page.

Cause: the value carried an HTML soft-hyphen ENTITY (Администри&shy;рование,
added for rail wrap). The two menu paths render menuName differently - the Reaper
dashboard substitutes <#menu5_6#> straight into HTML (entity decodes, invisible),
but the stock left-menu renderer emits menuName as TEXT, so the entity shows
literally. Same latent bug in TR menu5_2_1 ('Yerel Ağ IP&#39;si').

Fix (entity-free values that render identically in a text AND an HTML context):
- RU menu5_6: drop the &shy; -> 'Администрирование' (the wrap-hint only helped one
  path and was cosmetic).
- TR menu5_2_1: &#39; -> U+2019 right single quote, which renders as an apostrophe
  in a text context and can never break a single/double-quoted JS string (rule 29),
  unlike a bare ASCII apostrophe.
In-place value edits: all 25 dicts stay lockstep. NOT BUILT - rides a future rung.

RULE: menu-label dict tokens must not contain HTML entities - the stock menu
renderer shows them raw. Use literal Unicode characters.
---
 release/src/router/www/RU.dict | 2 +-
 release/src/router/www/TR.dict | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/release/src/router/www/RU.dict b/release/src/router/www/RU.dict
index 3c79a7659e..af87ef9b1a 100644
--- a/release/src/router/www/RU.dict
+++ b/release/src/router/www/RU.dict
@@ -587,7 +587,7 @@ menu5_5_3=Фильтр MAC-адресов
 menu5_5_4=Фильтр сетевых служб
 menu5_5_5=Фильтр ключевых слов
 menu5_5_6=Брандмауэр для IPv6
-menu5_6=Администри&shy;рование
+menu5_6=Администрирование
 menu5_6_1=Режим работы
 menu5_6_1_title=Режим работы
 menu5_6_2=Система
diff --git a/release/src/router/www/TR.dict b/release/src/router/www/TR.dict
index 12977a9d0c..dee3590945 100644
--- a/release/src/router/www/TR.dict
+++ b/release/src/router/www/TR.dict
@@ -567,7 +567,7 @@ menu5_1_4=Kablosuz MAC Filtresi
 menu5_1_5=RADIUS Ayarı
 menu5_1_6=Profesyonel
 menu5_2=Yerel Ağ
-menu5_2_1=Yerel Ağ IP&#39;si
+menu5_2_1=Yerel Ağ IP’si
 menu5_2_2=DHCP Sunucusu
 menu5_2_3=Rota
 menu5_3=WAN
